OL,3,GNEWSAVulnerable man cremated without
OL,4,Afamily's knowledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a vulnerable man who died
OL,7,Fin Bexhill have said they were shocked
OL,8,Fto learn he had been cremated without
OL,9,Ftheir knowledge.
OL,11,FChristopher Reader, 44, lived in
OL,12,Fsupported accommodation for several
OL,13,Fyears before living independently with
OL,14,Fvisits from carers, in a flat his
OL,15,Ffamily said had no heating or hot
OL,16,Fwater.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
