OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAVulnerable man cremated without
OL,4,Afamily's knowledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FReader's mother and brother believe
OL,7,FEast Sussex County Council (ESCC)
OL,8,Fneglected him, though a safeguarding
OL,9,Fenquiry did not find any evidence of
OL,10,Fthis. The family also believe the
OL,11,Fhandling of his cremation was "cold".
OL,13,FRother District Council (RDC) said in a
OL,14,Fletter apologising to the family that
OL,15,Fthe responsibility for contacting next
OL,16,Fof kin "usually lies with the funeral
OL,17,Fdirectors".
